OL,3,GNEWSAResidents return after apartment
OL,4,Ablock evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living in an apartment block
OL,7,Fin Nottingham have returned to their
OL,8,Fhomes after being evacuated due to a
OL,9,Fmajor water leak which "significantly
OL,10,Fcompromised" the fire safety of the
OL,11,Fbuilding.
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,F(NFRS) said it was made aware of the
OL,15,Fleak at Cranbrook House, on Cranbrook
OL,16,FStreet, on Friday and began evacuating
OL,17,Fresidents at about 00:00 BST on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
