OL,3,GNEWSAResidents return after apartment
OL,4,Ablock evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 60 people were moved from
OL,7,Fthe building, according to a statement
OL,8,Fissued by the fire service and
OL,9,FNottingham City Council.
OL,11,FIn an updated statement, NFRS said
OL,12,Fpeople were allowed back into their
OL,13,Fproperties at 20:00 BST after the leak
OL,14,Faffected the building's fire alarm
OL,15,Fsystems and lifts.
